      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could this be `const Rect::ComplementRect\u0026`? I see its just a float4 in the struct which seems trivial to copy, unsure of if reference semantics are worse or not because of that, but could still be marked const.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 171,
