      "writtenOn": "2026-07-31T20:21:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see thanks for the explanation that makes sense as to why I saw the other function in Rect.h also passed by value as well. Can we still mark it const so it\u0027d be `const Rect::ComplementRect drawBounds` (and in the other spot too) just to make it clear we are not modifying this value? Unless const also has some weird behavior I am not aware of relating to what you said. Other than that LGTM.",
